# CTR Reload Edition - what must never be committed.
#
# This repository contains source code only. It never contains data from the
# game (disc images, extracted files, models, textures, sounds, tracks) or
# content made by other people (custom tracks, music, characters, 3D models,
# voices, sound effects, images). tools/content_guard.py checks the same on
# GitHub, and tools/git-hooks/pre-push at push time:
#   git config core.hooksPath tools/git-hooks

# --- Game data: disc images and extracted files --------------------------
