# --- 3D models, audio, pictures and archives (often by other people) -----
# The types that tools/content_guard.py refuses (a test generates its files
# in code). Files that git already tracks stay tracked. In externals/SDL,
# the bundled copy of SDL, the types of its own pictures and sounds are not
# ignored: an SDL update that brings a new one shows up as untracked instead
# of being left out without a word, and the guard refuses it until ALLOWED
# in tools/content_guard.py lists it with its blob id.
*.ply
*.obj
*.fbx
*.blend
*.blend1
*.glb
*.gltf
*.dae
*.3ds
*.stl
*.abc
*.usd
*.usda
*.usdc
*.usdz
*.x3d
*.ma
*.mb
*.max
*.c4d
